                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "are the developers of this game serious...? this 'game' is absolutely terrible. its a bare shell in terms of content & they claim to use 'newtonian physics' (lol) yet whenever you try and hit a proper forehand or backhand or even a proper serve the ball barely makes it to the net. i wouldnt even say this game has potential. there are a couple far better simulators already out there with FAAAAAAR better physics than this. it is literally just a glorified pong game and i have never refunded a purchase so quickly in my life.",
